# ── Site media IS tracked ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# public/webflow (~394 MB) and public/gcpimages (~206 MB) hold the images and
# hero videos the live site serves. Vercel deploys `public/` straight from this
# repository, so these MUST be committed — excluding them (as an earlier commit
# did) produces a live site with missing images and no hero videos.
#
# Largest single file is ~8.5 MB, so plain git is fine: GitHub's hard limit is
# 100 MB per file, and Git LFS is not required. If this ever grows past a few GB,
# move the media to Supabase Storage / a CDN and rewrite the paths instead.
#
# public/__l5e is a captured build artefact (not referenced by any page), so it
# stays untracked to avoid ~2 MB of dead weight.
/public/__l5e/